	你先把陶瓮内壁的干痂刮洗干净，将酵心移入烘暖的新陶罐中慢养，稳稳护住了底酵。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_bakery_1")>><<money 260>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回早班烤炉 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
