	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	养活的老酵头刚上案，殡仪伙计卡莱布与老账房霍恩竟一前一后迈进门槛——船匠家属要一炉沉实肃穆的苦黑麦丧宴大圆包，霍恩侄女的满月席却要一炉刷满槐花蜜的甜酥喜花环，两边都指明要在正午钟响前出炉。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-bakery-2">
	<<mpcookicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "分档抢烤两炉 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-bakery-2">>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryBakery to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryBakery to Math.max(($mpJobStoryBakery or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Bakery_1 to ($mpJobReg_Bakery_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你利用主炉前膛猛火先抢烤刷蜜的喜花环，趁炉温回落的余热再将厚重的苦黑麦丧宴圆包推入后膛慢烘。正午钟响时，一甜一苦两盘面包一齐出炉，互不串味，卡莱布与霍恩齐声称赞。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_bakery_2")>><<money 680>><</if>>
		<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		前后膛换盘时慢了一步，喜花环沾了一丝黑麦烟气，你急忙重刷了一层橙花蜜遮味。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回烘焙前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[分档抢烤两炉 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "分档抢烤两炉">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpherbicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link "隔板分流麦香 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-bakery-2">>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryBakery to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryBakery to Math.max(($mpJobStoryBakery or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Bakery_1 to ($mpJobReg_Bakery_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你在主炉中央竖起铸铁隔热挡板，左侧撒迷迭香烤丧包，右侧垫湿桦木烤喜饼，两股香气各走各的排烟道。老师傅看在眼里，夸你已经摸透了石炉的脾气。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_bakery_2")>><<money 560>><</if>>
		<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		隔板卡槽有点松，你垫着厚手垫扶了半晌才没让热气串过去。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回烘焙前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[隔板分流麦香 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "隔板分流麦香">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link "请内尔搭手分装 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-bakery-2">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryBakery to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryBakery to Math.max(($mpJobStoryBakery or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Bakery_1 to ($mpJobReg_Bakery_1 or 0) + 1>>
	你请还没走远的送奶工内尔帮忙在外厅按红白丝带分装礼盒，自己专心盯紧炉口火候，两边主顾都顺当接到了热面包。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_bakery_2")>><<money 340>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回烘焙前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	</div>
<</if>>

