<<else>>
	早班收炉后，老师傅从柜底取出一只青釉小陶罐和一把柄上刻着麦穗纹的胡桃木长铲，当着老账房霍恩、卡莱布与送奶工内尔的面，把传世老酵头分了一半装进你的小陶罐里：「从今往后，这口石炉的头炉火与老酵种，都有你的一份名号。」
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-bakery-3">
	<<mpcookicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<link "亲手开烤头炉 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-bakery-3">>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryBakery to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryBakery to Math.max(($mpJobStoryBakery or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Bakery_3 to ($mpJobReg_Bakery_3 or 0) + 1>>
		你接过胡桃木长铲，用自己养护的子酵揉出十二只金黄饱满的签名麦穗圆包。出炉的一刻麦香飘满丰收街，三位常客纷纷举包道贺，老师傅将满师红封郑重塞进你手中。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_bakery_3")>><<money 1500>><</if>>
		<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		你握着新木铲还有些紧，第一铲推得稍偏，定下心神后才把整盘圆包稳稳烘熟。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回发酵内室 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[亲手开烤头炉 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "亲手开烤头炉">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 240>><<link "立下三家供契 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-bakery-3">>
	<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
