	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	雨后的午后，退休领航员温特斯与老乐手埃利奥特在靠窗座位拼桌，温特斯翻找旧航海日志时，带翻的撒盐黑咖啡不慎洇湿了一张对折的羊皮纸——正面是三十年前的雾角航道图，背面竟是用铅笔记下的半首失传旧港船歌。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-cafe-1">
	<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<link "吸干咖啡护纸 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-cafe-1">>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCafe to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCafe to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCafe or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_1 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你飞快取来细白吸墨纸与热烘帕，先吸走羊皮纸纹理间的咖啡液，再用骨刀背面轻轻刮去盐粒。航道图与铅笔音符毫发无损，温特斯与埃利奥特同时松了口气。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_cafe_1")>><<money 500>><</if>>
		<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		羊皮纸边缘缩了一下，你赶紧用玻璃镇纸压住四角才没让它卷曲。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回咖啡吧台 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[吸干咖啡护纸 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "吸干咖啡护纸">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcookicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 230>><<link "奉双味拼配茶 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-cafe-1">>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 230 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCafe to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCafe to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCafe or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_1 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你端上一壶半烘乌龙配咸奶盖，既合温特斯的咸口，又润埃利奥特的嗓子。两人一面品茶一面回忆当年旧港庆典的曲调，气氛顿时融洽起来。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_cafe_1")>><<money 440>><</if>>
		<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		奶盖打得稍薄，化进茶汤里，好在两人正专心看谱并未深究。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回咖啡吧台 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[奉双味拼配茶 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "奉双味拼配茶">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpreadicon>><<link "取描图纸摹写 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-cafe-1">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCafe to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCafe to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCafe or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_1 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_1 or 0) + 1>>
	你从吧台账本下取来两张半透明描图纸，帮他们趁字迹清晰先把残谱与海图分头描了下来。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
