		你在靠窗三号桌摆上屏风与三层司康塔，替三位常客续满手冲咖啡，将一场争论变成了温馨的怀旧茶会，引来满堂茶客静听。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_cafe_2")>><<money 560>><</if>>
		<<seductionskill 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		旁桌客人凑过来插话打乱了节奏，你费了不少口舌才替他们维持住清静。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回海风前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[主持窗边沙龙 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "主持窗边沙龙">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
