	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	秋汛头一网大青背银鳕刚抬上栈桥，酒馆采买厨师布鲁诺与冰厂罗婶带来的外埠鱼贩便同时按住了鱼筐——酒馆晚宴要最厚实的脊肉炸鱼排，外埠客商却想连冰带鱼整筐包走。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-fish-2">
	<<mpfishicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "快刀分切全鱼 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-fish-2">>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryFish to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryFish to Math.max(($mpJobStoryFish or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Fish_1 to ($mpJobReg_Fish_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你拔出窄刃分鱼刀，当场施展活鱼三枚切：最肥厚的背柳连皮带冰交布鲁诺送酒馆，胶质丰腴的鱼头与腹肉配罗婶的厚盐冰装箱外运，鱼骨则留给海风咖啡馆熬鲜鱼汤。一鱼三吃，三方皆大欢喜。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_fish_2")>><<money 700>><</if>>
		<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		下刀太急蹭破了一副鱼胆，你赶紧用柠檬盐水冲净才没染苦鱼柳。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回栈桥木棚 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[快刀分切全鱼 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "快刀分切全鱼">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpbargainicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 240>><<link "定下分潮供货 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-fish-2">>
	<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryFish to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryFish to Math.max(($mpJobStoryFish or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Fish_1 to ($mpJobReg_Fish_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你按早潮归外埠、晚潮归酒馆的规矩替两边排定交接钟点，罗婶包揽全部用冰，老鱼贩夸你比老掌柜还会做买卖。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_fish_2")>><<money 580>><</if>>
		<<englishskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
