<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深水泊位 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily.mpJobStoryFish>>
	今日这桩差事已经料理妥当，不急在一时。
<<elseif ($mpJobStoryFish or 0) gte 3>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	大潮之夜，哈克提来防雾风灯，罗婶备好整车盐冰，布鲁诺也带着酒馆红封候在栈桥。老鱼贩把那根祖传的鲸骨导线主竿与栈桥头等摊位木牌一并交到你手中：「今晚这趟大潮，由你掌竿开网！」
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-fish-3">
	<<swimicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<link "迎浪独起大网 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-fish-3">>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryFish to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryFish to Math.max(($mpJobStoryFish or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Fish_2 to ($mpJobReg_Fish_2 or 0) + 1>>
		你站在头等栈桥迎风处，算准第三道大涌抬升的刹那猛收总纲，满网泛着银光的深水大鳕鱼轰然跃上木板。布鲁诺与罗婶当场抢秤结算，老鱼贩将头等红利尽数推给你。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_fish_3")>><<money 1500>><</if>>
		<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		大网沉得超乎想象，你喊来哈克搭手才把这网大鱼稳稳拖上栈桥。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回深水泊位 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[迎浪独起大网 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "迎浪独起大网">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpfishicon>><<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 260>><<link "鲸骨竿钓鱼王 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-fish-3">>
	<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 260 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryFish to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryFish to Math.max(($mpJobStoryFish or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Fish_2 to ($mpJobReg_Fish_2 or 0) + 1>>
		你将鲸骨主竿甩入黑礁旋涡中心，与水下巨物周旋一刻钟后，一尾体长三尺的青背鳕王破水而出，满栈桥渔民轰然喝彩。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_fish_3")>><<money 1300>><</if>>
		<<swimmingskill 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		鱼王力道奇猛，拉得你虎口发麻，溜了三圈才勉强抄进大网兜。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回深水泊位 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[鲸骨竿钓鱼王 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "鲸骨竿钓鱼王">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "游泳等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link "挂起头等摊牌 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-fish-3">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryFish to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryFish to Math.max(($mpJobStoryFish or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Fish_2 to ($mpJobReg_Fish_2 or 0) + 1>>
	你将刻着自己名字缩写的头等摊位木牌挂上栈桥主柱，稳稳收下三位常客奉上的贺仪。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_fish_3")>><<money 900>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
