/* ==================== Spa 小故事 第一阶段：二号私汤的矿盐垢 ==================== */

:: MP Job Story Spa 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<if ($mpJobStorySpa or 0) is 2 and ($mpJobSpaExp or 0) gte 10>><<goto "MP Job Story Spa 3">><<elseif ($mpJobStorySpa or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobSpaExp or 0) gte 6>><<goto "MP Job Story Spa 2">><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回桑拿前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily.mpJobStorySpa>>
	今日这桩差事已经料理妥当，不急在一时。
<<elseif ($mpJobStorySpa or 0) gte 1>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	歌剧女高音塞西莉亚在二号私汤练声时，发现石壁泉眼的出水量比上月小了一半，蒸汽微薄。乔丹取来检修铜钥递给你：「地底温泉脉的方解石结晶堵了内槽，得趁歇业空当把泉眼疏通开。」
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-spa-1">
	<<mprepairicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 240>><<link "温醋软化盐晶 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-spa-1">>
	<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStorySpa to 1>><<set $mpJobStorySpa to Math.max(($mpJobStorySpa or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_1 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你用温热的柠檬白醋浸泡石槽出水口，等方解石结晶软化起泡后，用竹签顺着泉眼纹理整块挑出。滚烫清澈的泉水顿时喷涌而出，白雾瞬间盈满隔间，塞西莉亚试唱了一句高音，清亮婉转。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_spa_1")>><<money 520>><</if>>
		<<scienceskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		白醋倒得急了些，酸气呛得你打了个喷嚏，赶紧放清水冲了两遍池壁。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回桑拿前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[温醋软化盐晶 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "温醋软化盐晶">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 230>><<link "铜刷清疏石槽 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-spa-1">>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 230 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStorySpa to 1>><<set $mpJobStorySpa to Math.max(($mpJobStorySpa or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_1 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你挽起袖口用软铜丝刷将引水石槽从头到尾刷洗得光洁如新，连排水暗格里的积沙也一并掏净，水温立时回升两度。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_spa_1")>><<money 460>><</if>>
		<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		石槽弯角狭窄，手背蹭在粗石壁上红了一块才把深处盐壳抠出来。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回桑拿前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[铜刷清疏石槽 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "铜刷清疏石槽">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpherbicon>><<link "加挂迷迭香囊 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-spa-1">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStorySpa to 1>><<set $mpJobStorySpa to Math.max(($mpJobStorySpa or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_1 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_1 or 0) + 1>>
	你先通开表层盐块，又在出水口加挂了两只草药商赫伯特送来的迷迭香包，借草木热气润泽空气。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_spa_1")>><<money 300>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回桑拿前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	</div>
<</if>>

