	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	午后私汤最忙时，一号池的老议员夫人维奥拉要浓郁的甜橙乳香浴，紧挨着的二号池塞西莉亚却要极清透的薄荷润喉雾，偏偏两间私汤共用同一条主蒸汽石渠，草药商赫伯特正提着新药材候在火房外。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-spa-2">
	<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "双阀分流调香 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-spa-2">>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStorySpa to 1>><<set $mpJobStorySpa to Math.max(($mpJobStorySpa or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_2 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_2 or 0) + 1>>
		你在主蒸汽渠分叉口嵌入一层浆洗房送来的细密亚麻滤布，一号支管滴入甜橙精油，二号支管只过清冽的薄荷甘菊水汽。两间私汤一浓一清互不干扰，维奥拉夫人与塞西莉亚双双满意打赏。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_spa_2")>><<money 700>><</if>>
		<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		滤布扎得稍松，一丝甜橙味飘进了二号池，你赶紧开窗换气重调了水阀。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回私汤回廊 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[双阀分流调香 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "双阀分流调香">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240>><<link "引赫伯特配方 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-spa-2">>
	<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStorySpa to 1>><<set $mpJobStorySpa to Math.max(($mpJobStorySpa or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_2 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_2 or 0) + 1>>
		你请草药商赫伯特当场用甘菊露调和甜橙的燥气，调出一款既护嗓又养肤的复合香露，两位贵客试过后都争着预订下周的席位。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_spa_2")>><<money 580>><</if>>
		<<seductionskill 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		赫伯特话匣子一开说个不停，你费了不少工夫才把话题引回配香上。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回私汤回廊 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[引赫伯特配方 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "引赫伯特配方">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<link "封严隔间竹帘 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-spa-2">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStorySpa to 1>><<set $mpJobStorySpa to Math.max(($mpJobStorySpa or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_2 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_2 or 0) + 1>>
	你在两间私汤的夹壁透气窗上加挂了浸湿的厚棉帘阻隔气味，分头端进两套不同的香炉。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_spa_2")>><<money 340>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回私汤回廊 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	</div>
<</if>>

/* ==================== Spa 小故事 第三阶段：谢幕夜的包场私汤 ==================== */

:: MP Job Story Spa 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[返回古泉浴池 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily.mpJobStorySpa>>
	今日这桩差事已经料理妥当，不急在一时。
<<elseif ($mpJobStorySpa or 0) gte 3>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	塞西莉亚在市政音乐厅的谢幕独唱大获成功，当晚特意包下整座私汤回廊宴请维奥拉夫人与赫伯特，指名由你主持今晚的汤池侍奉。乔丹将那串掌管全馆泉眼总阀的纯铜钥匙圈郑重交到你手上。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-spa-3">
	<<mpherbicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<link "调四时百花汤 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-spa-3">>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStorySpa to 1>><<set $mpJobStorySpa to Math.max(($mpJobStorySpa or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_3 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_3 or 0) + 1>>
		你将农场春采的迷迭香、夏晒的薄荷、秋收的甘菊与冬藏的松针按序浸入四口汤池，热雾如云霞流转。塞西莉亚与维奥拉夫人盛赞这是全城最顶级的享受，将厚实的谢幕礼金放入你的银盘。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_spa_3")>><<money 1600>><</if>>
		<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		松针包浸得稍久，第四池味道偏浓，你及时注入清泉调匀了汤色。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回古泉浴池 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[调四时百花汤 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "调四时百花汤">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcookicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "掌管私汤总钥 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-spa-3">>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStorySpa to 1>><<set $mpJobStorySpa to Math.max(($mpJobStorySpa or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_3 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_3 or 0) + 1>>
		你将全套烘暖的云锦浴巾、温牛乳盅与清音茶井井有条地呈上，连乔丹都感叹如今私汤离了你便转不灵光。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_spa_3")>><<money 1300>><</if>>
		<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		端送四套茶盏时托盘沉重，你稳住呼吸才没让茶水晃出杯沿。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回古泉浴池 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[掌管私汤总钥 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "掌管私汤总钥">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link "收下总阀铜钥 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-spa-3">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStorySpa to 1>><<set $mpJobStorySpa to Math.max(($mpJobStorySpa or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_3 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_3 or 0) + 1>>
	你将纯铜总钥系在腰间，恭敬送别三位常客，正式挑起了温泉桑拿房大管事的担子。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_spa_3")>><<money 950>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回古泉浴池 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
