<<if $daily.mpJobStoryFarm>>
	今日这桩差事已经料理妥当，不急在一时。
<<elseif ($mpJobStoryFarm or 0) gte 3>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	秋收开镰之日，金红饱满的头茬麦穗堆满了晒谷场，套种的迷迭香也捆成了百十束。磨坊主霍利斯、草药商玛莎与老佃农巴恩斯齐聚谷仓，亚历克斯将田庄总账册与温室金铜钥匙交到你手中。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-farm-3">
	<<mpfarmicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<link "执掌头镰开割 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-farm-3">>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryFarm to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryFarm to Math.max(($mpJobStoryFarm or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Farm_1 to ($mpJobReg_Farm_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你挥动磨得雪亮的大弯镰领头开割，麦束整齐码上板车，过秤斤两创下河湾十年之最。霍利斯与玛莎当场签下常年包销长契，亚历克斯分给你一份沉甸甸的庄园主红利。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_farm_3")>><<money 1600>><</if>>
		<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		头垄麦秆密实沉重，你挥镰挥得掌心发热，一鼓作气割通了全畦。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回三畦农田 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[执掌头镰开割 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "执掌头镰开割">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 240>><<link "签下直供长契 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-farm-3">>
	<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryFarm to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryFarm to Math.max(($mpJobStoryFarm or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Farm_1 to ($mpJobReg_Farm_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你代表河湾农场与磨坊、面包房、咖啡馆及桑拿房签定四方直供契书，成了全镇生计链条最核心的供货总管。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_farm_3")>><<money 1300>><</if>>
		<<englishskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		契书一式四份，你写得手腕发酸才把印鉴全部盖齐。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回三畦农田 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[签下直供长契 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "签下直供长契">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcalculateicon>><<link "登账封存新麦 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-farm-3">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryFarm to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryFarm to Math.max(($mpJobStoryFarm or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Farm_1 to ($mpJobReg_Farm_1 or 0) + 1>>
	你将头茬麦种封入顶层防潮仓，收下三位常客与亚历克斯奉上的丰收贺礼。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_farm_3")>><<money 950>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回三畦农田 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	</div>
<</if>>

/* ==================== Clock 小故事 第一阶段：候车室母钟的温差 ==================== */

:: MP Job Story Clock 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<if ($mpJobStoryClock or 0) is 2 and ($mpJobClockExp or 0) gte 10>><<goto "MP Job Story Clock 3">><<elseif ($mpJobStoryClock or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobClockExp or 0) gte 6>><<goto "MP Job Story Clock 2">><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回修表柜台 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily.mpJobStoryClock>>
	今日这桩差事已经料理妥当，不急在一时。
<<elseif ($mpJobStoryClock or 0) gte 1>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	老火车站副站长康纳用绒布箱抬来候车室主母钟的双金属补偿摆轮：「入秋后昼夜温差大，母钟白日走快两秒、夜里走慢三秒，整条铁路的发车表都跟着受牵连。」塞拉把精密千分尺推到你手边。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-clock-1">
	<<mpclockworkicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 250>><<link "推算温差配重 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-clock-1">>
	<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryClock to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryClock to Math.max(($mpJobStoryClock or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Clock_1 to ($mpJobReg_Clock_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你测出黄铜与钢片外圈的膨胀差值，将摆轮外缘的四枚微调金螺丝对称往内旋入一圈半。经过冷热两番实测，日差缩至零点二秒以内，康纳副站长惊叹不已。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_clock_1")>><<money 540>><</if>>
		<<mathsskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		第一次配重略偏，摆轮在低温下还是慢了半秒，你又细调了一遍才完全合拍。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回修表柜台 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[推算温差配重 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "推算温差配重">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "算术等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mprepairicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 240>><<link "洗净玛瑙刀口 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-clock-1">>
	<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryClock to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryClock to Math.max(($mpJobStoryClock or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Clock_1 to ($mpJobReg_Clock_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你用鹿皮蘸无水酒精擦净悬挂摆轮的玛瑙刀口轴承，消除了凝油带来的摩擦阻力，母钟摆幅立时恢复均匀。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_clock_1")>><<money 480>><</if>>
		<<scienceskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		玛瑙刀口极滑，你屏住呼吸稳住镊子才没让垫片滑落。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回修表柜台 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[洗净玛瑙刀口 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "洗净玛瑙刀口">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpwatchicon>><<link "记录昼夜秒差 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-clock-1">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryClock to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryClock to Math.max(($mpJobStoryClock or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Clock_1 to ($mpJobReg_Clock_1 or 0) + 1>>
