		<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		三套裁片堆在一处险些混了里衬，你赶紧用粉笔在反面标清姓氏缩写。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回裁缝铺面 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[立裁三套版型 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "立裁三套版型">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpsewicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<link "巧设隐形活扣 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-tailor-1">>
