		预约主顾太多，你核对了半下午才把下月的量体排期排满。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回阁楼副台 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[接掌高定名册 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "接掌高定名册">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpsewicon>><<link "收下首席银剪 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-tailor-3">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryTailor to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryTailor to Math.max(($mpJobStoryTailor or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Tailor_3 to ($mpJobReg_Tailor_3 or 0) + 1>>
	你郑重收好老裁缝传给你的首席金柄银剪，稳稳挑起了高街裁缝铺的大梁。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_tailor_3")>><<money 950>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回阁楼副台 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	</div>
<</if>>

/* ==================== Courier 小故事 第一阶段：三街交汇的连廊图 ==================== */

:: MP Job Story Courier 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<if ($mpJobStoryCourier or 0) is 2 and ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) gte 10>><<goto "MP Job Story Courier 3">><<elseif ($mpJobStoryCourier or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) gte 6>><<goto "MP Job Story Courier 2">><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回代办窗口 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily.mpJobStoryCourier>>
	今日这桩差事已经料理妥当，不急在一时。
<<elseif ($mpJobStoryCourier or 0) gte 1>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	报馆排字工汉克、药剂师温德尔与钟表学徒芬恩同时在代办亭投递限时急件——一份送往高街报亭、一份送往医院、一份送往钟表铺，全要求在两刻钟内签收。老掌柜把一张空白街区草图推给你。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-courier-1">
	<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 240>><<link "测算最优环线 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-courier-1">>
	<<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCourier to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCourier to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCourier or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_1 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你算出穿过商业街骑楼、高街钟塔后巷与医院侧门的三角环线，一趟顺路串起三家收件点，比往常省下一半脚程。三份回执准点拍回窗口，老掌柜大声叫好。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_courier_1")>><<money 520>><</if>>
		<<mathsskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		高街中段恰逢卸货马车堵路，你翻过一道矮墙才把时间抢回来。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回代办窗口 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[测算最优环线 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "测算最优环线">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "算术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<link "疾步实测暗巷 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-courier-1">>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCourier to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCourier to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCourier or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_1 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你背起邮包一口气跑通三条鲜为人知的屋檐连廊，在草图上标明每一处台阶与捷径，温德尔与芬恩都夸你神速。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_courier_1")>><<money 460>><</if>>
		<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		跑得太急在石阶上崴了一下脚，好在及时扶住墙砖没摔着药匣。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回代办窗口 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[疾步实测暗巷 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "疾步实测暗巷">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link "分轻重缓急送 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-courier-1">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCourier to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCourier to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCourier or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_1 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_1 or 0) + 1>>
	你先送最怕化冰的温德尔药匣，再顺路交芬恩的表件与汉克的清样，稳妥跑完三单。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_courier_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回代办窗口 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	</div>
<</if>>

/* ==================== Courier 小故事 第二阶段：大雾锁城的盲送夜 ==================== */

:: MP Job Story Courier 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<if ($mpJobStoryCourier or 0) is 2 and ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) gte 10>><<goto "MP Job Story Courier 3">><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回分拣木架 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily.mpJobStoryCourier>>
	今日这桩差事已经料理妥当，不急在一时。
<<elseif ($mpJobStoryCourier or 0) gte 2>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	深秋海雾锁住了整座城镇，五步之外只见昏黄灯晕。汉克的号外清样与芬恩的航海钟急件必须在夜航船开拔前送达码头与高街，连老邮差都不敢轻易钻巷。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-courier-2">
	<<mpsneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "凭砖纹摸近道 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-courier-2">>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCourier to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCourier to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCourier or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_2 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_2 or 0) + 1>>
		你凭着脚下盲道石砖的凹凸纹路与各铺面飘出的烤面包香、钟表滴答声，在浓雾里如履平地般穿行，分秒不差地将两份急件送到收件人手中。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_courier_2")>><<money 700>><</if>>
		<<skulduggery 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		雾气太浓，你在岔路口多摸索了两步，靠听钟塔报时才校正方向。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回分拣木架 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[凭砖纹摸近道 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "凭砖纹摸近道">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpreadicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 240>><<link "核准门楣暗记 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-courier-2">>
	<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCourier to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCourier to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCourier or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_2 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_2 or 0) + 1>>
		你对照自己画的跳号门牌表，用防雾风灯贴近门楣逐一核准，在伸手不见五指的雾夜里做到了零差错面签。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_courier_2")>><<money 580>><</if>>
		<<englishskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		风灯玻璃蒙了一层雾水，你擦了三次灯罩才看清暗巷门牌。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回分拣木架 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[核准门楣暗记 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "核准门楣暗记">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<link "摇铜铃沿街走 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-courier-2">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCourier to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCourier to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCourier or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_2 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_2 or 0) + 1>>
	你沿着大路边缘石栏稳步快走，凭代办亭铜铃声与收件人呼应交接，平安完成夜班。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_courier_2")>><<money 340>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回分拣木架 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	</div>
<</if>>

