<<else>>
	你的手绘《全城连廊与暗巷跳号密图》让代办亭的准点率冠绝全镇。老掌柜特意装裱好木框，当着汉克、温德尔与芬恩的面将密图钉在代办亭正墙，把总调度铜印交到你手中。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-courier-3">
	<<runicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<link "统管全镇快线 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-courier-3">>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCourier to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCourier to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCourier or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_3 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_3 or 0) + 1>>
		你按快慢缓急将全城跑腿路线分为三班接力，报馆、药房与钟表铺齐齐签下长期专送大单，老掌柜将头等干股分红塞进你怀里。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_courier_3")>><<money 1600>><</if>>
		<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		新学徒还不熟暗巷拐角，你亲自带跑了两趟才让他们彻底记牢。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回派送亭口 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[统管全镇快线 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "统管全镇快线">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 250>><<link "创设火漆专签 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-courier-3">>
	<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCourier to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCourier to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCourier or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_3 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_3 or 0) + 1>>
		你设计了防伪双色火漆回执签，贵重件损耗降为零，三位常客纷纷为你奉上丰厚贺金。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_courier_3")>><<money 1300>><</if>>
		<<mathsskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
