	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link "接过调度铜印 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-courier-3">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryCourier to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryCourier to Math.max(($mpJobStoryCourier or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_3 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_3 or 0) + 1>>
	你把总调度铜印挂在帆布挎包内侧，在三位常客的道贺声中接掌了街巷跑腿行。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_courier_3")>><<money 900>><</if>>
