/* ==================== PubKitchen 小故事 第一阶段：避风船员的三十碗汤 ==================== */

:: MP Job Story PubKitchen 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<if ($mpJobStoryPubKitchen or 0) is 2 and ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) gte 10>><<goto "MP Job Story PubKitchen 3">><<elseif ($mpJobStoryPubKitchen or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) gte 6>><<goto "MP Job Story PubKitchen 2">><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回后厨灶台 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily.mpJobStoryPubKitchen>>
	今日这桩差事已经料理妥当，不急在一时。
<<elseif ($mpJobStoryPubKitchen or 0) gte 1>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	傍晚海上突变狂风，水手长布兰德带着三十名刚下船的水手涌进丰收街酒馆避风，船木匠老乔里与巡夜人麦考伊也挤在吧台边，转眼间三十碗热汤与炸鱼排的点单压满了传菜窗。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-pubkitchen-1">
	<<mpcookicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<link "双锅并灶出餐 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-pubkitchen-1">>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryPubKitchen to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryPubKitchen to Math.max(($mpJobStoryPubKitchen or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你将大炖锅里的黑啤牛肉原汤分出一半兑入鲜鱼高汤，左灶滚汤、右灶猛火炸银鳕鱼排，短短两刻钟便连出三十份滚烫套餐。水手们吃得欢声雷动，布兰德拍下一把银币。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_pubkitchen_1")>><<money 540>><</if>>
		<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		油锅连下三批鱼排后油温略降，你赶紧添柴催火才没让面糊脱壳。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回后厨灶台 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[双锅并灶出餐 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "双锅并灶出餐">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 7400>><<link "独扛大桶续酒 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-pubkitchen-1">>
	<<if ($physique or 0) gte 7400 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryPubKitchen to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryPubKitchen to Math.max(($mpJobStoryPubKitchen or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 or 0) + 1>>
