/* ==================== PubKitchen 小故事 第二阶段：秘制黑啤卤汁的火候 ==================== */

:: MP Job Story PubKitchen 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
