<<else>>
	胖厨长今日要去港口验看大宗香料，临走前把后厨最核心的那口百年老卤锅交给照看——那是巡夜人麦考伊与船木匠老乔里每晚必点的秘制黑啤炖牛腩。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-pubkitchen-2">
	<<mpcookicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "文火慢煨收汁 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-pubkitchen-2">>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryPubKitchen to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryPubKitchen to Math.max(($mpJobStoryPubKitchen or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_2 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_2 or 0) + 1>>
		你算准黑麦酒头沫消退的时机，撇净浮油，下入烘香的杜松子、月桂叶与一勺面包房黑麦焦糖，文火慢煨三个时辰。揭盖时浓香飘出半条街，麦考伊连汤带肉吃了个精光。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_pubkitchen_2")>><<money 700>><</if>>
		<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		中途炭火旺了一阵，你及时加了半瓢高汤不停手地搅底，才没让卤汁粘锅。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回地窖石阶 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[文火慢煨收汁 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "文火慢煨收汁">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpherbicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "巧配鱼羊鲜汤 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-pubkitchen-2">>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
