		你将鱼档送来的银鳕鱼骨烤香后熬成奶白底汤，调入后厨炖肉卤中，鲜醇滋味令老乔里惊为天人，当场多订了三桌席面。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_pubkitchen_2")>><<money 580>><</if>>
		<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		熬鱼骨时火大了些，你用细纱布滤了两遍才去净骨渣。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回地窖石阶 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[巧配鱼羊鲜汤 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "巧配鱼羊鲜汤">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
