	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryPubKitchen to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryPubKitchen to Math.max(($mpJobStoryPubKitchen or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_2 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_2 or 0) + 1>>
	你严格按照胖厨长留在黑板上的刻钟记号定时添入黑麦啤酒，稳稳守住了老卤原味。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_pubkitchen_2")>><<money 340>><</if>>
