<<else>>
	入秋阴雨天，车队的领头栗色马左后踝旧伤复发，迈步时有些微跛。粮商吉尔伯特下周有二十车冬储麦要运往高街，铁匠巴尔德也拎着工具箱赶来会诊，老马夫让你一起拿主意。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-stable-1">
	<<mpfirstaidicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "热酒糟敷消肿 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-stable-1">>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryStable to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryStable to Math.max(($mpJobStoryStable or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Stable_2 to ($mpJobReg_Stable_2 or 0) + 1>>
		你用酒馆后厨送来的温热麦酒糟混入农场迷迭香，替栗色马后踝热敷包扎，每日早晚轻柔按摩活血。三天后肿块全消，栗色马在院里撒欢奔跑，吉尔伯特悬着的心终于落了地。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_stable_1")>><<money 540>><</if>>
		<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		栗色马起初怕痒乱踢，你顺着鬃毛哄了半晌才把药布缠紧。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回马厩院内 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[热酒糟敷消肿 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "热酒糟敷消肿">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpsmithicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 230>><<link "配合巴尔德改掌 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-stable-1">>
	<<if ($science or 0) gte 230 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryStable to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryStable to Math.max(($mpJobStoryStable or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Stable_2 to ($mpJobReg_Stable_2 or 0) + 1>>
		你与铁匠巴尔德一起测量栗色马的落蹄角度，在左后蹄铁内侧加垫了一层倾斜软牛皮卸力，走起石板路来稳当无比。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_stable_1")>><<money 480>><</if>>
		<<scienceskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
