	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回马厩院内 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[配合巴尔德改掌 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "配合巴尔德改掌">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpanimalicon>><<link "调换轻便副辕 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-stable-1">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryStable to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryStable to Math.max(($mpJobStoryStable or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Stable_2 to ($mpJobReg_Stable_2 or 0) + 1>>
	你先把栗色马调去拉轻便的空草车养脚力，把重车分给其余壮马，稳妥护住了头马。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
