		<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		过桥顶时后轮滑了半尺，你果断喝令副马加力，一鼓作气拽过了坡顶。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回草料侧棚 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[双马并辕领坡 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "双马并辕领坡">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "铺草垫石护轮 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-stable-2">>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryStable to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryStable to Math.max(($mpJobStoryStable or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Stable_3 to ($mpJobReg_Stable_3 or 0) + 1>>
		你提着铁锹在石桥上下坡道铺满干草屑与碎石防滑，又逐车检查双套绳结，整支车队无一滑轮。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_stable_2")>><<money 600>><</if>>
		<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		来回跑了二十趟坡道，小腿酸胀不堪，好歹保住了全队平安。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回草料侧棚 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[铺草垫石护轮 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "铺草垫石护轮">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<link "分段减载过桥 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-stable-2">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryStable to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryStable to Math.max(($mpJobStoryStable or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Stable_3 to ($mpJobReg_Stable_3 or 0) + 1>>
	你安排重车在桥头卸下三成麦袋用小车分批推过桥顶，虽多花了些工夫，却万无一失。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_stable_2")>><<money 350>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回草料侧棚 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
