<</if>>

/* ==================== Stable 小故事 第三阶段：头马的黄铜响铃 ==================== */

:: MP Job Story Stable 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[返回车队木架 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily.mpJobStoryStable>>
	今日这桩差事已经料理妥当，不急在一时。
<<elseif ($mpJobStoryStable or 0) gte 3>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	二十车冬储粮分毫不损地入库交割，创下河湾马厩历年最快纪录。粮商吉尔伯特、铁匠巴尔德与老邮差托马斯在马厩摆下庆功酒，老马夫解下那枚象征车队总把头的虎头黄铜响铃交到你手中。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-stable-3">
	<<mpanimalicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 270>><<link "系响铃领车队 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-stable-3">>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 270 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryStable to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryStable to Math.max(($mpJobStoryStable or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Stable_1 to ($mpJobReg_Stable_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你亲手将虎头黄铜响铃系在栗色领头马颈下，清脆浑厚的铃声传遍河湾。吉尔伯特当场签下全年粮草押运长契，老马夫将车队总押运红利分了你一半。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_stable_3")>><<money 1700>><</if>>
		<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		栗色马亲昵地用脑袋蹭你的手心，你系了两次才把红绒铃带系得端端正正。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回车队木架 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[系响铃领车队 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "系响铃领车队">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpsmithicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<link "立下远线规程 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-stable-3">>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryStable to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryStable to Math.max(($mpJobStoryStable or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Stable_1 to ($mpJobReg_Stable_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你与巴尔德、托马斯定下城郊驿马换乘与蹄铁定检规矩，让河湾马厩成了连接城乡最稳固的枢纽。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_stable_3")>><<money 1400>><</if>>
		<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		核对十二匹挽马的换掌排期花了一下午，条条理得清清楚楚。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回车队木架 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[立下远线规程 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "立下远线规程">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link "接掌押运木牌 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-stable-3">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryStable to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryStable to Math.max(($mpJobStoryStable or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Stable_1 to ($mpJobReg_Stable_1 or 0) + 1>>
	你收好总押运木牌与三位常客奉上的贺礼，成了河湾马厩当之无愧的领队人。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_stable_3")>><<money 950>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回车队木架 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	</div>
<</if>>

/* ==================== Trawler 小故事 第一阶段：黑礁边缘的旧海图 ==================== */

:: MP Job Story Trawler 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">><<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>><</if>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<if ($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0) is 2 and ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) gte 10>><<goto "MP Job Story Trawler 3">><<elseif ($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) gte 6>><<goto "MP Job Story Trawler 2">><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回渔船跳板 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily.mpJobStoryTrawler>>
	今日这桩差事已经料理妥当，不急在一时。
<<elseif ($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0) gte 1>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	独眼船长在船舱油灯下摊开半张磨破边的羊皮海图，指着外海黑礁南侧的一道深水海沟：「年轻时我在那儿见过成群的大青鳕，只是两侧暗礁像狼牙一样密。补网妇梅芙今晚替咱们加固底纲，你敢不敢跟我去探探水路？」
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-trawler-1">
	<<mpsewicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link "助梅芙编护网 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-trawler-1">>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryTrawler to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryTrawler to Math.max(($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Trawler_3 to ($mpJobReg_Trawler_3 or 0) + 1>>
		你与补网妇梅芙坐在防波堤灯下，在主拖网底纲外侧加编了一层防刮牛皮护条与活扣浮球。次日试航刮过礁缘，护网完好无损，梅芙夸你手艺老道。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_trawler_1")>><<money 540>><</if>>
		<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		牛皮护条又硬又滑，你用铁锥扎穿了十几个孔才把底纲缝牢。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回渔船跳板 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[助梅芙编护网 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "助梅芙编护网">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<swimicon>><<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>><<link "船头看水探沟 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-trawler-1">>
	<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryTrawler to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryTrawler to Math.max(($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Trawler_3 to ($mpJobReg_Trawler_3 or 0) + 1>>
		你趴在船头迎着海浪，凭着深浅水色交界的墨绿波纹，帮独眼船长精准标出了黑礁海沟的进出航道。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_trawler_1")>><<money 480>><</if>>
		<<swimmingskill 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		浪花扑面而来，你抹去眼角咸水盯了半个时辰才认准水道缺口。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回渔船跳板 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[船头看水探沟 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "船头看水探沟">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "游泳等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpwatchicon>><<link "核对罗盘方位 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-trawler-1">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryTrawler to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryTrawler to Math.max(($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0), 1)>><<set $mpJobReg_Trawler_3 to ($mpJobReg_Trawler_3 or 0) + 1>>
	你协助船长把黑礁海沟与雾角灯塔的十字方位角记在航海簿上，稳妥完成了初探。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_trawler_1")>><<money 300>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回渔船跳板 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	</div>
<</if>>

/* ==================== Trawler 小故事 第二阶段：海雾夜的灯塔引航 ==================== */

