<<elseif ($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0) gte 2>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	拖网船正式驶入黑礁海沟下网的那天傍晚，满网深水大青鳕刚绞出水，四周便漫起了伸手不见五指的浓雾。岸上的鱼商克劳斯急等着这批头等鲜货，老灯塔守望人摩根在雾角塔顶拉响了第一声雾号。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-trawler-2">
	<<mprowicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<link "把舵稳绞重网 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-trawler-2">>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryTrawler to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryTrawler to Math.max(($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Trawler_2 to ($mpJobReg_Trawler_2 or 0) + 1>>
		你一面根据摩根的雾角间隔秒数替船长修正舵角，一面领着水手随浪谷节拍稳扳棘轮，将千斤重的满兜大青鳕悉数绞进甲板，半尾未漏。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_trawler_2")>><<money 740>><</if>>
		<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		横浪打来时船身剧晃，你死死顶住绞盘止退销才没让网兜滑回海里。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回甲板绞盘 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[把舵稳绞重网 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "把舵稳绞重网">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpclockworkicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 250>><<link "听雾钟算航速 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-trawler-2">>
	<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryTrawler to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryTrawler to Math.max(($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Trawler_2 to ($mpJobReg_Trawler_2 or 0) + 1>>
		你对照船首黄铜罗盘与灯塔铜钟回音，算出退潮横流的速度，引着渔船从两座暗礁正中毫发无损地穿出浓雾。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_trawler_2")>><<money 620>><</if>>
		<<scienceskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		雾里回音嘈杂，你连测了三次船速浮标才彻底锁定安全航向。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回甲板绞盘 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[听雾钟算航速 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "听雾钟算航速">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpfishicon>><<link "铺冰护住青鳕 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-trawler-2">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryTrawler to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryTrawler to Math.max(($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobReg_Trawler_2 to ($mpJobReg_Trawler_2 or 0) + 1>>
	你带着学徒在底舱飞快铲冰铺盐，把刚起上来的大青鳕镇得严严实实，静候船长穿雾靠岸。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_trawler_2")>><<money 350>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回甲板绞盘 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	</div>
<</if>>

/* ==================== Trawler 小故事 第三阶段：大副的黄铜船哨 ==================== */

:: MP Job Story Trawler 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">><<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>><</if>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[返回船首锚台 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily.mpJobStoryTrawler>>
	今日这桩差事已经料理妥当，不急在一时。
<<elseif ($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0) gte 3>>
	这一章的事务已经办妥，等你在这行当里攒足资历，后续的安排自会浮现。
<<else>>
	满舱罕见的深水大青鳕在三号防波堤一开舱，鱼商克劳斯当场以双倍高价全舱包圆。老灯塔守望人摩根与补网妇梅芙也赶来码头道贺，独眼船长摘下挂在胸前二十年的大副黄铜船哨，亲手系在你衣领上。
	<br><br>
	<div id="mp-job-story-trawler-3">
	<<swimicon>><<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 270>><<link "吹哨掌舵出航 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#mp-job-story-trawler-3">>
	<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 270 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryTrawler to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryTrawler to Math.max(($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Trawler_1 to ($mpJobReg_Trawler_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你吹响清越的大副船哨，亲自掌舵驶上黑礁深水新航线。克劳斯与船队签下全年头等舱包销契，独眼船长将大副干股与满舱红利拍在你掌心。<span class="green">这桩关口被你漂亮地拿下了。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_trawler_3")>><<money 1800>><</if>>
		<<swimmingskill 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		外海大浪拍击船首，你稳稳把住舵轮，引着单桅拖网船破浪前行。<span class="red">差了一口气，只能改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回船首锚台 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[吹哨掌舵出航 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "吹哨掌舵出航">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "游泳等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpfishicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<link "统管甲板起网 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-story-trawler-3">>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 and random(1, 4) gte 2>>
		<<set $daily.mpJobStoryTrawler to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryTrawler to Math.max(($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Trawler_1 to ($mpJobReg_Trawler_1 or 0) + 1>>
		你号令全船水手起网分鱼，从甲板绞盘到底舱盐冰井然有序，整座旧港码头都认下了你这位年轻大副。<span class="green">你的巧思让事情顺利推进了一步。</span>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_trawler_3")>><<money 1450>><</if>>
		<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		连起三网大鱼累得肩膀发沉，看着满舱银光却觉得浑身是劲。<span class="red">一时没能奏效，还得再寻时机。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回船首锚台 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[统管甲板起网 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "统管甲板起网">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link "收好大副船哨 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-story-trawler-3">>
	<<set $daily.mpJobStoryTrawler to 1>><<set $mpJobStoryTrawler to Math.max(($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0), 3)>><<set $mpJobReg_Trawler_1 to ($mpJobReg_Trawler_1 or 0) + 1>>
	你握紧温热的黄铜船哨，在三位常客与全体水手的欢呼声中正式成了拖网船的二当家。<span class="teal">你稳扎稳打地办妥了这一步。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_story_trawler_3")>><<money 980>><</if>>
	<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回船首锚台 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
	<</replace>><</link>>
	</div>
<</if>>
